nd i do remember  reading about that i do remember that  paul rudd did write an entire ant-man  script by himself and he actually had a  lot of crazy cool stuff in the script  and modoc was one of them and it looks  like they liked that marvel studios  liked it the direct goes on to say given  that aim was also a part of this past  version and the group's association with  the villain it's likely that the  organization will also make an  appearance alongside modok too now  here's the big question what role will  modoc have in ant-man and the wasp  quantum mania because jonathan major's  king is supposed to be the big bad  villain not just of ant-man and the wasp  quantomania but of the mcu so where does  this other big villain take place what's  his role well there's speculation right  now about two possible answers to this  and if you didn't know modok is actually  an acronym and it stands for mechanized  organism designed only for killing he  works for aim but due to an experiment  gone wrong he ends up taking over aim  and he gets a over developed freakishly  huge head but has insane genius level  intellect and psionic powers so here's  the two roles that modok could have in  ant-man 3. one is that he could actually  be a rival to king kang is a genius and  if we're dealing with nathaniel richards  he actually comes from the future a very  very advanced future and given what we  learned from loki no doubt kang  definitely has some plans however i'm  assuming modoc probably has some plans  as well and as the direct points out  there is a chance that the plans could  kind of interlap with each other and one  of them might get in the way of  another's so we could see modoc and kang  clashing heads however as the direct  points out an alternative could be that  modok may actually help kang he could be  an asset to king the king we met in loki  was well aware of his variants in fact  i'm pretty sure all kings would be aware  of their variants since they all went to  war with one another and history tends  to repeat itself so we can assume it'll  happen again and if that's the case the  king that will meet an ant-man and the  wasps quantomania might want to get rid  of the others and modoc is a mechanized  organism designed only for killing if  you're trying to kill somebody he  probably would do a good job especially  if you wanted somebody smart on your  side so kang and modok could actually be  working together in ant-man quantum  mania and let's also not forget that  bill murray is going to be joining  ant-man 3 as well this has been  confirmed maybe he's playing an aim  member who knows but this movie is  looking to be truly epic and not to  mention cassie lang should be becoming  stature and this could be the start of  the young avengers now unfortunately  we'll have to wait until mid 2023 to  find out but luckily there is a lot  happening in the mcu before then but let  me know how excited you are about a  shanghi sequel about a 10 rings  organization disney plus show focused on  xylene and of course about ant-man and  the wasp quantum mania let me know down  below don't forget to like the video and  for live updates you can always follow  me on instagram and twitter and as  always thank you all so much for  watching woof  [Music]  you

